$DATUM stereoselective, Wadsworth-Emmons reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis and biological evaluation of novel resveratrol-oxadiazole
hybrid heterocycles as potential antiproliferative agents
